                    "syntax": "HOST[:SERVICE]",
                    "grammar": "One token: host with optional :service, [IPv6]:service, or :service using the backend's empty-host handling. A service can be a numeric port or backend service name; a host without :service retains the separately selected/default port, normally 4433. Endpoint parsing does not treat a bare host string as a numerical index."
